{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます\nこんにちは\nこんばんは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2015/08/26/9316813/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お爪とツーショット♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛、LIVE期間中\n去年の全国ツアーより\n成長した私達。\n成長した\nテラダを見て頂きたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残すは東京 神宮のみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"命の前髪を乱して"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2015/08/26/9316813/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、8月21日は特別な日でした\n乃木坂4周年\n欅坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＵＴＢさん発売日でしたo(^o^)o\nＵＴＢ＋さんで初めての\nソログラビアを経験して"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2015/08/26/9316813/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐ、好評につき\nＵＴＢ様で\n10ページandポスターもあります♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂からは衛藤さんも\n載ってます\n衛藤さんが可愛い綺麗o(^o^)oo(^o^)o\nきっと可愛い\n女の子沢山載ってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生2回目のソログラビア\nまだ、2回目もっともっと\n勉強しなきo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願い致します"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂46○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ、私も何もわかりません\nどうしていいかわかりません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、早くお会いしたい\n歳も近い子が多いので\nこのブログ見てくれてる\n欅坂さんいるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nテラダ頑張ります\nうまくは言えませんが\n高みを目指します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"o(^o^)o\nらんぜの勢い\nとまらんぜ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2015/08/26/9316813/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方まわってきた感想"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年はLIVE最中に心が折れること\n沢山ありました\nこんな事言ってしまうのも\nファンの皆様には申し訳ない気もしますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年はわたしのうちわ持ってる方\n居たのかな、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVE中\nもう無理かもって思ってしまった事もありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今年はそんなことなかった\n沢山自分の背中を押してくれる方が\n増えた気がします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に歩いてくれる方が\n増えて嬉しい限りです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私ですが\nこれからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから\nよ